  <h2>Use the laws with an AI assistant</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/downloads/software-laws-skill.zip">software-laws skill</a> teaches an assistant to apply these entries to a real situation, including how each one gets misused. Add it in Claude under Settings, then Capabilities, then Skills. Agents can also find it at <a href="/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json">/.well-known/agent-skills/</a>.</p>
  <p>Every entry is available as <a href="/laws.json">JSON</a>, and each page has a Markdown version at the same address ending in <code>.md</code>, such as <a href="/laws/brookss-law.md">/laws/brookss-law.md</a>.</p>
